      "source": "To modify properties of the underlying <code>ServerContainer</code>\nyou can use <a href=\"ServletServerContainerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.standard\"><code>ServletServerContainerFactoryBean</code></a> in XML configuration or,\nwhen using Java configuration, access the container instance through the\n\"jakarta.websocket.server.ServerContainer\" ServletContext attribute.",
      "translation": "要修改底层 <code>ServerContainer</code> 的属性，您可以在 XML 配置中使用 <a href=\"ServletServerContainerFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.server.standard\"><code>ServletServerContainerFactoryBean</code></a>，或者在使用 Java 配置时，通过 \"jakarta.websocket.server.ServerContainer\" ServletContext 属性访问容器实例。",
